  "DescIdentified": {
    "type": "cexolocstring",
    "value": {
      "0": "This plate has withstood the crushing blows of mountain-shattering strikes. The bronze-hued metal is masterfully worked to be as light as a traveler's pack while remaining an iron wall against the heavy maces of the deep. A faint scent of soot lingers in its joints."
    }
