  "Description": {
    "type": "cexolocstring",
    "value": {
      "0": "Deeply etched runes across the bronze-hued plates catch the light, though the metal carries the faint scent of soot and forge-fire. This suit of mail fits like a second skin, providing a solid, unyielding barrier against the world."
    }
  },
